{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261118/photo/bkn-20261118172959407-1118_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261118190251\"/><p>事發電燈中心地下電掣房。(陳嘉順攝)</p><p>今午(18日)5時17分，北角城市花園道28號電燈中心，地下停車場電掣房突然起火爆炸，一名姓黎(28歲男)子猝不及防，面部及雙手燒傷。消防到場開喉將火救熄，戒備，救援車趕至把受傷事主送院救治。消防經初步調查後，相信有變壓器故障引致火警，現階段並無證據顯示案件涉及刑事成分。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T11:24:01.014323+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":163,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T09:29:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T12:17:19.361264+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T11:17:16.244122+00:00","content_hash":"672613787995c08b6976fc07676a5e47e1d42fbfb9bd6af11b6dcf9fd7e424cf","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T11:24:01.014323+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}